@startuml
title 图8-1 安卓客户端组件依赖（D）
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
package "Android UI" {
  [MainActivity\n已编码/CI可编译] as UI
}
package "会话与结果" {
  [AnswerSession\n已验证] as Session
  [KeywordMatcher\n已验证] as Match
  interface "RecognitionAdapter" as Adapter
}
package "输入与执行" {
  [PcmRecorder\n已编码/待真机验证] as Capture
  [DemoAdapter\n模拟·非识别证据] as Demo
  [RemoteAdapter\n已编码/待 B 联调] as Remote
  [LocalSherpaAdapter\n已编码/待真机验证] as Local
}
package "记录与身份" {
  [RecordStore\n加密/账号过滤] as Store
  [IdentityGateway\n本机测试身份] as Id
  [AnalysisPort\n扩展边界已编码] as Analysis
}
UI --> Capture : 启停
UI --> Adapter : 选择路径、收结果
UI --> Session : 主线程更新
Session --> Match : 完整最终文本
UI --> Store : 保存/读取/删除
UI --> Id : 本机测试身份
UI ..> Analysis : 保留扩展边界
Demo ..|> Adapter
Remote ..|> Adapter
Local ..|> Adapter
Capture --> Adapter : PCM16+样本位置
Remote --> "B 的 WSS 服务" : float32/Done
Local --> "sherpa-onnx JNI" : 本地推理
Store --> Id : canAccess
@enduml
